  "details": "Problem:\n\nPublic NSFW avatars are frequently reported and taken down.\n\nCurrent system doesn’t differentiate between underage users or those who want to avoid NSFW content.\n\nCreators lose their work unfairly; users lose access to avatars they’re legally allowed to use.\n\nProposed Solution:\n\nNSFW Tag for Avatars – Creators can mark an avatar as NSFW during upload.\n\nAge Verification Lock – Only users 18+ can see or use avatars marked NSFW.\n\nOptional Public Visibility – NSFW avatars remain public, but only visible to verified users.\n\nReport Protection – NSFW avatars can’t be reported by underage users or those outside the 18+ filter.\n\nBenefits:\n\nProtects creators from random takedowns.\n\nEnsures minors don’t see NSFW content.\n\nKeeps public avatar library more organized.\n\nSatisfies both creative freedom and platform safety concerns.",
